      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is an issue affecting both Unity 6 and regular Betas. For me, it only appears in VR mode and seems to be a direct result of being on the latest SteamVR Beta 2.17.4 and above, which includes the new Steam UI. Switching to live steamvr immediately allows to get through the connecting issue.",
